    "title": "Maricopa County Sheriff's Office to host Waddell town hall - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago Members of the Maricopa County Sheriff’s Office will host a town hall tomorrow in Waddell.\nTopics will cover community concerns and public safety and will include an open forum for questions, concerns and feedback\nIt is set for 6 to 8 p.m. at Mountain View School, 18302 W Burton Ave., Waddell.\nA Spanish interpreter will be available for accessibility to all community members.",
